---
description: Use Context7 MCP for library docs when implementing Nexus features
globs:
  - backend/**/*
  - frontend/**/*
  - tests/**/*
---

When generating or changing code that depends on external libraries (FastAPI, Pydantic, Next.js, Chroma, LangChain, Anthropic/OpenAI SDKs, SlowAPI, python-jose, etc.), use the **Context7** MCP tools to fetch current documentation before proposing APIs or config. Do not guess deprecated method signatures.
